namespace pdg { /**

\var pdg::eventType_SpriteAnimate

\brief A Sprite reports an animation, fade, or visibility action.

\details Inspect `action` to identify the notification. Frame-loop/end and
visibility notifications have per-Sprite opt-in controls. Blend-completion
notifications use pdg::action_AnimationBlendComplete. Authored Spriter triggers
use pdg::eventType_SpriteTriggerEvent and a pdg::SpriteTriggerEvent payload.

\see SpriteAnimateEvent

\ingroup Events


**/ }